+        expectText('4000', 125, 750, '$what undone');
+      }
+
+      // 1:50 mm → 1:100 ft-in, one command. 4000 / 25.4 = 157.48"; in
+      // quarters 629.92 → 630 = 13 × 48 + 6: 13'-1 1/2". The text 2.5 × 100
+      // = 250 tall, 1 × 100 = 100 above the line: (2000, 800). The line
